01:37.100 --> 01:41.980
-Spain- Practice Field of FC Cataluña

01:43.780 --> 01:47.320
I see Tsubasa hasn't been sent to the substitutes' field yet.

01:47.320 --> 01:53.280
Yeah, he's doing well in these practice games playing on the substitute team.

01:53.280 --> 01:57.610
He might not get the starting position, but at least he'll be on the bench.

01:59.540 --> 02:00.460
Tsubasa.

02:00.460 --> 02:01.620
Yes!

02:02.190 --> 02:05.430
Play right midfielder on the regulars' team.

02:07.100 --> 02:09.140
Tsubasa's joining the regulars?

02:09.140 --> 02:11.220
As a right midfielder instead of a playmaker?!

02:16.960 --> 02:18.860
Tsubasa, here.

02:28.140 --> 02:30.660
Yes, I'll do my best!

02:30.660 --> 02:31.530
All right!

02:31.530 --> 02:35.180
Tsubasa is already joining the regulars' side!

02:35.180 --> 02:40.180
This has to mean that Coach Edward has recognized Tsubasa's talent.

02:41.740 --> 02:44.750
All right, everybody get to your position.

02:44.750 --> 02:45.870
Yes, sir!

02:48.360 --> 02:52.500
No matter what position I play, I'll give it my all, playing my way!

02:53.040 --> 02:58.230
And I'll grab my place as a starting member in the Spanish League opener!

03:03.060 --> 03:08.220
<b>A Harsh Notice</b>

03:03.060 --> 03:08.220
<b>A Harsh Notice</b>

03:08.710 --> 03:11.740
What? Everybody's denied access except journalists.

03:11.740 --> 03:15.440
The training for the league games is getting serious.

03:18.210 --> 03:21.060
Isn't there some way to get inside?

03:28.120 --> 03:29.900
Now's my chance!

03:30.700 --> 03:32.780
I'm not kidding!

03:39.150 --> 03:41.380
And then, he...

03:48.990 --> 03:51.460
I've got to hurry.

03:55.720 --> 03:59.330
Wow! Tsubasa is playing on the regulars' side!

04:06.410 --> 04:10.000
This is an unspoken appeal from Rivaul-san!

04:10.000 --> 04:15.020
"In this Spanish League, you have to be able to reach such passes!"

04:16.410 --> 04:17.930
Here it goes!

04:21.250 --> 04:22.770
It's in!

04:27.240 --> 04:29.540
Nice pass, Rivaul-san!

04:32.900 --> 04:35.730
Quite some nerves Tsubasa has!

04:35.730 --> 04:39.350
He doesn't seem to know what the words "shrink back" mean.

04:39.350 --> 04:40.180
You're right about that.

04:42.180 --> 04:44.300
Rivaul and Tsubasa, huh?

04:44.300 --> 04:47.250
Is this the birth of Cataluña's Golden Duo?

04:47.250 --> 04:48.800
Oh, that'll be nice!

04:48.800 --> 04:50.220
He did it! He did it!

04:50.220 --> 04:52.380
Bravo, Tsubasa! Bravo!

04:52.380 --> 04:55.520
Kiddo, where did you enter?

04:55.520 --> 04:57.820
Oops, darn it!

04:58.940 --> 05:00.100
Hey, wait!

05:00.660 --> 05:04.580
-Italy- Turin

05:06.660 --> 05:10.820
Practice Field of FC Piemonte

05:13.780 --> 05:15.710
All right, who's going to go first?

05:18.370 --> 05:20.700
That Var Len Fort is all worked up again!

05:20.700 --> 05:22.700
So, who will it be?

05:30.230 --> 05:36.230
If we're playing with just two top forwards this season, then only two will be regulars, huh?

05:38.720 --> 05:39.600
What's wrong?

05:39.600 --> 05:41.700
Hurry up and go at it, one by one!

05:41.700 --> 05:43.580
All right, I'll be up first!

05:44.070 --> 05:46.100
Okay, here's a cross in front of the goal.

05:46.950 --> 05:49.860
Pacciani Lamberto, from Italy's national team,

05:49.860 --> 05:54.020
a <i>fantasista</i> who's recognized by everyone as Piemonte's ace. {and no, if the Japanese don't know what a "fantasista" is, then I'm not putting up a note explaining what the hell that means either :P)}

06:07.720 --> 06:08.420
Shit!

06:08.420 --> 06:11.430
This is how you do it.

06:11.430 --> 06:12.420
I'm up next!

06:13.380 --> 06:16.410
Maroni Francesco, from Italy's national team,

06:16.410 --> 06:19.660
he's known worldwide for his technical play and his speed.

06:23.020 --> 06:25.020
Yes!

06:27.380 --> 06:28.260
Me, too!

06:32.080 --> 06:35.980
Théodore, from France's national team. Komasevic, from Yugoslavia's national team.

06:35.980 --> 06:38.980
And Esnandez, from Argentina's national team.

06:39.880 --> 06:41.630
They're all really good!

06:41.630 --> 06:44.240
Hey, <i>giapponese!</i> It's your turn!

06:46.500 --> 06:48.100
Go at it, Hyuga!

06:50.090 --> 06:50.740
Damn it!

06:52.760 --> 06:54.520
Me, having the jitters?

06:56.100 --> 06:58.500
Hey, newbie! You're too stiff!

06:58.500 --> 07:00.730
Relax! Relax!

07:00.730 --> 07:01.580
Damn!

07:03.270 --> 07:04.620
I'm going for my second one!

07:04.620 --> 07:06.100
Not yet!

07:07.120 --> 07:10.220
You failed to trap the ball. Your turn's done!

07:10.220 --> 07:11.900
I'm not done yet!

07:14.970 --> 07:17.100
As if I'd ever give up!

07:22.880 --> 07:23.540
What?

07:24.910 --> 07:29.140
<i>The</i> Var Len Fort didn't move an inch!

07:31.300 --> 07:33.540
I...

07:33.790 --> 07:38.670
I'll show them that my level is good enough for the Italian League!

07:42.530 --> 07:49.050
Hyuga, the power of your right leg is more than enough for this league.

07:49.620 --> 07:50.660
However...

07:53.770 --> 07:54.860
Focus!

07:54.860 --> 07:56.300
Over here!

07:58.130 --> 07:59.420
Over here! Over here!

07:58.910 --> 07:59.430
Let's go at it! {TLC: I only heard one thing being spoken at/near this time, so I don't understand why there's an overlapping line here.}

08:11.220 --> 08:12.620
I've got it!

08:14.830 --> 08:16.380
Nice, Bernhardt-san!

08:17.520 --> 08:19.380
That was a nice ball, Tsubasa!

08:21.230 --> 08:22.180
Time's up!

08:22.840 --> 08:25.730
After a five-minute break, we'll go at it again.

08:25.730 --> 08:26.700
Yes!

08:27.080 --> 08:28.370
Tsubasa.

08:28.370 --> 08:28.940
Yes!

08:28.940 --> 08:33.690
During the next round, play in the center rear together with Grandios.

08:33.690 --> 08:34.930
Y-Yes.

08:34.930 --> 08:38.430
Hey, he's changing Tsubasa's position again!

08:38.430 --> 08:43.380
First, he was on the right side of the midfield, then the left side.

08:43.750 --> 08:46.020
And this time he's the defensive midfielder, huh?

08:46.570 --> 08:50.260
I really wonder where the coach intends to use Tsubasa.

08:50.260 --> 08:51.510
No idea.

08:55.130 --> 08:57.330
There's no time to think.

08:57.330 --> 08:57.950
Come on.

08:57.950 --> 08:59.020
Y-Yes.

08:59.370 --> 09:03.020
We'll play together maintaining a balance between offense and defense, okay?

09:04.060 --> 09:05.020
Yes.

09:11.440 --> 09:16.020
Grandios-san, Cataluña's captain, and member of the Spanish squad.

09:23.470 --> 09:25.860
Putini-san, from France's squad.

09:29.260 --> 09:31.550
Albert-san, from the Dutch team.

09:33.040 --> 09:38.980
And Alaberdo-san and Payol-san, from Spain's team.

09:39.990 --> 09:43.140
They're all top-rated players from around the world.

09:44.000 --> 09:44.580
Tsubasa!

09:46.030 --> 09:50.760
On the field, it doesn't matter who we are. We're all chasing the ball.

09:50.760 --> 09:54.620
Grandios-san is right. I don't have time to think.

09:55.700 --> 10:00.540
Between all these splendid players, will I be able to show my strength?

10:00.540 --> 10:01.660
That's everything!

10:02.600 --> 10:04.940
It doesn't matter where I play.

10:04.940 --> 10:10.410
Playing together with these awesome players, I know I'll get better!

10:10.410 --> 10:13.460
And most importantly, I'm having fun!

10:15.690 --> 10:19.580
I'm having so much fun with soccer!

10:30.420 --> 10:32.080
We're in real trouble!

10:32.080 --> 10:33.130
If he keeps this up,

10:33.130 --> 10:34.860
he'll be a starter!

10:34.860 --> 10:37.380
We need to take the ball from him at all costs!

10:37.380 --> 10:42.320
Awesome! Tsuabsa and Rivaul are completely in sync!

10:42.320 --> 10:45.750
Bravo! Tsubasa! Rivaul!

10:48.600 --> 10:50.380
Hey, kid. It's you again?!

10:50.380 --> 10:52.280
Oh, no!

10:52.280 --> 10:54.080
Wait up!

10:56.240 --> 10:57.300
Tsubasa!

11:00.060 --> 11:02.390
Come at me, Spanish League!

11:02.390 --> 11:06.940
I can't wait to stand on your fields!

11:08.460 --> 11:10.180
Nice, Tsubasa!

11:12.420 --> 11:13.910
Well done, Tsubasa!

11:13.910 --> 11:17.380
At this rate, him being a regular in the starting game is not just a dream.

11:17.380 --> 11:18.820
No, that's the problem.

11:18.820 --> 11:23.280
Tsubasa is showing great talent in every position.

11:23.280 --> 11:27.060
Does that mean the coach is testing him in every position because he's uncertain?

11:27.560 --> 11:35.050
So, I'm really curious about which regular position Tsubasa will obtain.

11:46.420 --> 11:47.710
Wow!

11:47.710 --> 11:49.620
That's it! Keep it up!

11:49.620 --> 11:53.800
This is a good place. Spain is more laid back than Japan.

11:53.800 --> 11:56.020
Everybody lives as they feel like.

11:56.020 --> 12:00.060
We, too, could've relaxed more if we didn't have work to do.

12:00.060 --> 12:03.580
By the way, which position do you think Tsubasa will have?

12:04.180 --> 12:06.890
Nozaki-san, I swear when it comes to Ohzora Tsubasa you...

12:06.890 --> 12:16.460
I just want to see how the most glorious player from Japan is going to play in Spain.

12:16.460 --> 12:19.010
I'm kind of curious about that, too.

12:19.010 --> 12:23.150
Let's have a bet then. The winner gets a free meal.

12:23.150 --> 12:24.200
That's nice.

12:24.200 --> 12:25.570
I'm betting on the left side.

12:25.570 --> 12:27.170
Then, I'll go for defensive midfielder.

12:27.170 --> 12:27.980
Hey, hey!

12:28.370 --> 12:29.740
We're just having fun.

12:29.740 --> 12:34.650
A-All right, I'll go for the right side then.

12:34.650 --> 12:36.740
I'm going for the playmaker.

12:37.140 --> 12:38.630
If I recall, you are...

12:38.630 --> 12:40.020
Hey, let me in on the bet, too.

12:40.020 --> 12:41.740
There's a free meal in it, right?

12:43.080 --> 12:45.230
Forget about it. Your bet is going nowhere.

12:45.230 --> 12:49.980
As long as Rivaul is playing, Tsubasa can't have that spot, no matter what he does.

12:49.980 --> 12:54.170
It's like they said. First, he has to make it as a starter.

12:54.170 --> 12:59.260
He's always been the playmaker, but he'll have to change positions.

13:01.260 --> 13:02.740
Bah.

13:23.370 --> 13:24.220
Come in.

13:25.480 --> 13:26.830
Excuse me.

13:31.580 --> 13:33.940
You called me, Coach?

13:33.940 --> 13:35.460
Yes.

13:35.460 --> 13:40.460
Tsubasa, I want to clear up one thing before the opening match.

13:40.460 --> 13:41.580
Yes?

13:42.200 --> 13:46.420
Tsubasa, which position do you want to play?

13:46.420 --> 13:47.410
Eh?

13:53.680 --> 13:58.970
These last few days, I've made you play various positions.

13:59.970 --> 14:04.700
I want to know which position you want to occupy.

14:21.340 --> 14:22.470
I...

14:26.640 --> 14:31.580
During the National Boys Soccer Tournament in elementary school, {ugh name, research to find out what we really used}{you mean back in the original Tsubasa series? screw that - kk} I was a forward.

14:32.070 --> 14:35.860
I was Nakatsu FC's ace striker.

14:36.280 --> 14:42.780
It was then that Roberto told me about the importance of being the playmaker,

14:42.780 --> 14:46.780
and since then I've always aimed for that position.

14:47.830 --> 14:51.180
I then became Nakatsu Middle School's playmaker,

14:51.180 --> 14:53.780
and I also became the leader and the top scorer.

14:54.700 --> 14:58.290
And together we won the Nationals three times.

15:12.590 --> 15:16.900
After that, I've always been playing as the playmaker.

15:18.020 --> 15:21.120
It's always been where I felt I belonged.

15:21.860 --> 15:22.890
But...

15:22.890 --> 15:23.980
Tsubasa.

15:24.340 --> 15:27.860
Play right midfielder on the regulars' team.

15:29.180 --> 15:32.900
Since I came to Cataluña, I've played on the right side,

15:32.900 --> 15:36.420
the left side, and defensive midfielder - all so the coach can test me.

15:38.490 --> 15:41.310
No matter the position, it was interesting.

15:41.310 --> 15:46.550
The pleasure of playing together with awesome players, starting with Rivaul-san,

15:46.550 --> 15:48.300
is something that's irreplaceable.

15:52.420 --> 15:56.670
But if the coach asks me which position I want to play...

15:56.670 --> 15:57.590
I...

16:00.050 --> 16:02.830
Coach, the position I'd like to play...

16:08.520 --> 16:09.860
is playmaker.

16:13.930 --> 16:16.270
All right, we're done talking.

16:18.980 --> 16:20.230
Excuse me.

16:33.650 --> 16:35.010
I have no regrets.

16:35.610 --> 16:38.190
I'm clear about it now.

16:39.080 --> 16:42.660
I want to be the playmaker of FC Cataluña.

16:43.190 --> 16:46.560
But since Rivaul-san's here, it will be hard to be a regular.

16:47.140 --> 16:49.870
I still got a chance though.

16:50.430 --> 16:55.800
I'll do my best and accept the coach's decision.

16:58.430 --> 16:59.910
All right!

17:02.250 --> 17:04.110
Tsubasa, it's here.

17:04.110 --> 17:04.950
Thanks.

17:05.950 --> 17:07.920
It's Brazilian cuisine.

17:07.920 --> 17:09.160
It feels nostalgic, doesn't it?

17:10.340 --> 17:13.180
Okay, Tsubasa, dig in without holding back.

17:13.700 --> 17:15.640
Thank you very much!

17:15.640 --> 17:18.560
It's so nostalgic to be eating Brazilian food again!

17:18.560 --> 17:21.220
Note: Brazillian cheese buns

17:18.560 --> 17:21.220
These <i>pão de queijo</i> mama made are delicious.{@sangofe: I so hope you're not doing this. You know the original Japanese audience didn't get a TL note for pao quiejos, so why should we insert it here?}

17:21.220 --> 17:22.790
I love them.

17:22.790 --> 17:24.330
Oh, really?

17:29.350 --> 17:31.600
Yeah, they're really good!

17:32.420 --> 17:36.290
You think so? I'm glad. I've made lots, so don't hold back.

17:41.740 --> 17:45.140
Tsubasa, the coach called you up today, didn't he?

17:45.140 --> 17:46.940
What did you talk about?

17:46.940 --> 17:52.940
The coach asked me which position I want to play.

17:52.940 --> 17:57.340
I see. And your answer was?

17:57.340 --> 17:58.620
I...

18:00.870 --> 18:02.590
You don't have to answer.

18:02.590 --> 18:05.800
That's only between you and the coach anyway.

18:11.150 --> 18:14.140
Hey, Tsubasa, what's Japan like?

18:15.200 --> 18:17.140
I want to know, too.

18:18.030 --> 18:20.960
Well, Japan is...

18:22.830 --> 18:25.100
Oh, is it really like that?

18:25.100 --> 18:26.720
That's amazing!

18:29.140 --> 18:30.340
Thanks for the food!

18:30.340 --> 18:32.400
Tsubasa, come see us again!

18:33.140 --> 18:36.600
Promise to play the soccer video game with me.

18:36.600 --> 18:39.660
Yeah, I will. I'll be back.

18:40.300 --> 18:42.090
Be careful on your way back.

18:42.090 --> 18:44.310
Good night, Tsubasa!

18:44.850 --> 18:47.660
Yes, good night.

18:47.670 --> 18:49.660
Bye-bye, Tsubasa!

18:50.240 --> 18:51.460
Bye-bye!

18:52.660 --> 18:55.990
All right. It's late now, so brush your teeth and go to bed.

18:55.990 --> 18:57.420
Okay.

19:01.750 --> 19:04.970
Tsubasa is just like you when you were younger.

19:04.970 --> 19:05.910
Eh?

19:06.700 --> 19:12.670
Well, he's thinking about soccer more than 90% of the time.

19:13.700 --> 19:15.940
Aren't you glad? You've found a nice apprentice.

19:17.120 --> 19:18.500
I wonder about that.

19:18.500 --> 19:19.740
Eh?

19:20.310 --> 19:23.860
To me, Tsubasa is more like a rival.

19:30.910 --> 19:35.200
The Spanish League starts in a week.

19:36.900 --> 19:41.580
I'll do everything to win the league 
championship together with Rivaul-san!

19:59.870 --> 20:02.330
Tsubasa, the coach is calling you.

20:02.330 --> 20:03.020
Yes.

20:04.010 --> 20:05.810
Not yet?

20:06.340 --> 20:08.520
They really are late this morning.

20:10.790 --> 20:11.470
Eh?

20:11.470 --> 20:14.590
I-I understand. I'll call you back later.

20:15.820 --> 20:18.720
There's big news from Italy! {@sangofe "taihen" means something major happened, and it doesn't necessarily have to be bad, and the fact that Hyuga may get to replace a starting member who is injured isn't exactly terrible news}

20:18.720 --> 20:19.580
What's the matter?

20:20.200 --> 20:24.580
Pacciani, Piemonte's ace, is injured and can't play in the opener.

20:24.580 --> 20:25.590
What?

20:25.590 --> 20:28.590
Does that mean Hyuga gets to debut as a starter?

20:29.550 --> 20:32.340
Yes, there's a good chance for that.

20:32.340 --> 20:33.620
Super!

20:37.440 --> 20:39.050
Thanks for waiting.

20:39.050 --> 20:40.620
Today before practice,

20:40.620 --> 20:44.770
the coach will be making an announcement about Tsubasa Ohzora.

20:44.770 --> 20:47.100
I'll take you to the press room.

20:47.100 --> 20:48.160
Follow me.

20:48.160 --> 20:50.620
It's finally time to know Tsubasa's position?

20:50.620 --> 20:53.340
Will he get his starting debut at the same time as Hyuga?

20:53.340 --> 20:55.680
That would make some noise in Japan!

21:08.560 --> 21:11.980
Tsubasa, you'll be the playmaker,

21:13.330 --> 21:15.940
but on the reserve team.

21:18.960 --> 21:27.580
You'll be joining the reserves, Cataluña's B Team.

21:52.690 --> 21:54.300
The reserve team....

21:54.920 --> 21:56.910
Cataluña's B Team?

21:58.380 --> 22:03.940
I won't be made a regular?

22:04.020 --> 22:10.580
Preview

22:04.990 --> 22:07.620
I got the message about playing for Cataluña's B Team.

22:08.480 --> 22:10.660
Guided by the team doctor, Mendez-san,

22:10.660 --> 22:14.900
I headed for the practice grounds 
overlooking Cataluña Stadium.

22:14.900 --> 22:18.900
Over there, I found a bridge leading to the stadium I love.

22:18.900 --> 22:20.460
